(B) Still cameras shall meet the following minimum specifications:
(i) Automatic still frame;
(ii) Capable of being concealed where feasible;
(iii) Remote activation;
(iv) Quiet activation;
(v) Must be digital format of at least four megapixels quality;
(vi) Capable of producing good quality color photographs;
(vii) Automatic focus;
(viii) Easily accessible for film loading and maintenance;
(ix) Capable of showing signs or signals of activation covertly; and
(x) Have wide-angle capability.
